@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="clinic-card border-0 shadow-sm" style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
    <div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center text-center mb-5 border-bottom pb-4">
        <div class="bg-primary bg-opacity-10 text-primary rounded-circle d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center mb-3 shadow-sm" style="width: 80px; height: 80px;">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved fa-2x"></i>
        </div>
        <h2 class="mb-2 fw-bold text-dark">Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p class="text-muted mb-0">Your privacy is critically important to us.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="text-muted" style="line-height: 1.8;">
        
        <p>Hawassa University IoT Student Clinic respects your privacy regarding any information we may collect while operating our clinic management system. This Privacy Policy applies to all users of the HUIOT Clinic Management System.</p>

        <h5 class="text-dark mt-4 fw-bold">1. Information We Collect</h5>
        <p>We only collect personal information that is necessary for the administration of clinical services. This includes patient demographics, medical histories, laboratory results, and prescription records. For staff members, we collect basic profile information required for role-based access control.</p>

        <h5 class="text-dark mt-4 fw-bold">2. How We Use Information</h5>
        <p>The clinical data collected is strictly used to provide medical care, manage patient queues, issue prescriptions, and maintain comprehensive health records. Analytical data is aggregated to generate daily and monthly reports to improve clinic operations.</p>

        <h5 class="text-dark mt-4 fw-bold">3. Data Security</h5>
        <p>We prioritize the security of your medical data. The system utilizes role-based access control, ensuring that only authorized clinical staff can access sensitive patient information. We employ industry-standard encryption protocols to protect data during transmission and storage.</p>

        <h5 class="text-dark mt-4 fw-bold">4. Contact Us</h5>
        <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or how we handle your personal information, please contact the Health Officer or the System Administrator at Hawassa University IoT.</p>
        
        <p class="small mt-5 pt-3 border-top">Last updated: @DateTime.Now.ToString("MMMM yyyy")</p>
    </div>
</div>
